<h1>{{ terms.scope }}</h1>
<h2>In scope</h2>
<ul>
<li>Orders, Shipments, Customers and Product Catalogue as sources</li>
<li>{{ usecase.metrics | join(', ') }}, by region and product line</li>
<li>Daily refresh, available by 6am local time</li>
</ul>
<h2>Out of scope</h2>
<ul>
<li>Real-time/streaming updates (daily batch only, for this iteration)</li>
<li>Returns and refunds data</li>
<li>Non-retail channels (wholesale, marketplace)</li>
</ul>
